flowchart TB
  CLIENT[Untrusted mobile/browser client] --> API[API validates auth + input]
  API --> POLICY[Authorization policy: role + owner + status + context]
  POLICY --> DOMAIN[Domain service with explicit state transition]
  DOMAIN --> DB[(Database constraints + transaction)]
  DOMAIN --> AUDIT[Audit/outbox event]
  API --> FILES[Authorized short-lived upload/download URL]
  FILES --> PRIVATE[Private object store + malware scanning]
  ADMIN[Admin user with strong MFA] --> ADMINAPI[Separate privileged routes]
  ADMINAPI --> POLICY
  ADMINAPI --> AUDIT
  PSP[External PSP] --> WEBHOOK[Webhook signature/timestamp verification]
  WEBHOOK --> DEDUPE[Unique durable event ID + idempotent processor]
  DEDUPE --> DOMAIN
